      "summaries": {
        "en": "omlx is an LLM inference server optimized for Apple Silicon, enabling efficient local AI via a macOS menu bar app. It uses continuous batching to maximize GPU utilization and SSD caching to offload models, reducing memory pressure. You can run models like Llama or Mistral locally with OpenAI-compatible APIs, ideal for prototyping or privacy-sensitive tasks without cloud dependencies.",
        "zh": "omlx 是一个专为 Apple Silicon 优化的 LLM 推理服务器，通过 macOS 菜单栏应用轻松管理本地 AI 模型。其核心技术是连续批处理（continuous batching），能动态合并请求以最大化 GPU 利用率；同时利用 SSD 缓存将模型部分数据暂存到硬盘，显著降低内存占用。你可以在本地运行 Llama、Mistral 等开源模型，并通过兼容 OpenAI 的 API 调用，非常适合原型开发或隐私敏感场景。无需依赖云端，即可在 Mac 上体验高性能推理。",
        "es": "omlx is an LLM inference server optimized for Apple Silicon, enabling efficient local AI via a macOS menu bar app. It uses continuous batching to maximize GPU utilization and SSD caching to offload models, reducing memory pressure. You can run models like Llama or Mistral locally with OpenAI-compatible APIs, ideal for prototyping or privacy-sensitive tasks without cloud dependencies.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "omlx stands out for apple-silicon, inference-server, and llm in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "omlx is an LLM inference server optimized for Apple Silicon, enabling efficient local AI via a macOS menu bar app. It uses continuous batching to maximize GPU utilization and SSD caching to offload models, reducing memory pressure. You can run models like Llama or Mistral locally with OpenAI-compatible APIs, ideal for prototyping or privacy-sensitive tasks without cloud dependencies.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/jundot/omlx for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
