      "summaries": {
        "en": "gstack is a curated set of 23 opinionated AI tools designed to replicate the roles of a CEO, designer, engineer manager, and QA in one CLI. It bundles Claude Code with specialized prompts and workflows, enabling solo developers to handle complex product cycles without a team. The key insight is its role-based orchestration: each tool encapsulates a specific expertise, from ideation to deployment. You can use it to accelerate prototyping, automate code reviews, or simulate a full-stack team for side projects.",
        "zh": "gstack 是一套包含23个高度定制化AI工具的命令行工具集，旨在为单人开发者提供虚拟完整团队支持，涵盖CEO、设计师、工程经理及QA等角色。其核心思路是将Claude Code与角色化提示词及工作流深度绑定，每个工具封装一个专业角色，覆盖产品构思、设计、编码、发布及测试全流程。技术亮点在于通过角色编排实现多视角协作，避免单一模型输出盲区。用户可快速验证产品想法、自动生成设计稿和代码审查，或作为个人项目全栈加速器，无需组建团队即可体验从0到1的",
        "es": "gstack is a curated set of 23 opinionated AI tools designed to replicate the roles of a CEO, designer, engineer manager, and QA in one CLI. It bundles Claude Code with specialized prompts and workflows, enabling solo developers to handle complex product cycles without a team. The key insight is its role-based orchestration: each tool encapsulates a specific expertise, from ideation to deployment. You can use it to accelerate prototyping, automate code reviews, or simulate a full-stack team for side projects.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "gstack gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "gstack is a curated set of 23 opinionated AI tools designed to replicate the roles of a CEO, designer, engineer manager, and QA in one CLI. It bundles Claude Code with specialized prompts and workflows, enabling solo developers to handle complex product cycles without a team. The key insight is its role-based orchestration: each tool encapsulates a specific expertise, from ideation to deployment. You can use it to accelerate prototyping, automate code reviews, or simulate a full-stack team for side projects.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/garrytan/gstack for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
