      "summaries": {
        "en": "This cross-encoder model re-ranks search results by scoring query-document relevance, improving accuracy over initial retrievers. It uses a BERT-based MiniLM architecture fine-tuned on MS MARCO, balancing speed and precision. Technically, it jointly encodes query and document into a single relevance score, enabling deeper semantic matching. You can integrate it into a two-stage retrieval pipeline: first retrieve candidates via bi-encoders, then re-rank with this model. Ideal for search engines, QA systems, or any application needing precise text ranking.",
        "zh": "这是一个基于MiniLM架构的交叉编码器模型，用于搜索结果重排序。它将查询与文档拼接后共同编码，输出单一相关性分数，实现深层语义匹配。模型在MS MARCO数据集上微调，兼顾速度与准确性。可集成到两阶段检索流程：先用双编码器快速召回候选文档，再由此模型精确重排。适用于搜索引擎、问答系统等需要精准文本排序的场景，提升结果相关性。",
        "es": "This cross-encoder model re-ranks search results by scoring query-document relevance, improving accuracy over initial retrievers. It uses a BERT-based MiniLM architecture fine-tuned on MS MARCO, balancing speed and precision. Technically, it jointly encodes query and document into a single relevance score, enabling deeper semantic matching. You can integrate it into a two-stage retrieval pipeline: first retrieve candidates via bi-encoders, then re-rank with this model. Ideal for search engines, QA systems, or any application needing precise text ranking.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "ms-marco-MiniLM-L12-v2 stands out for sentence-transformers, pytorch, and jax in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "This cross-encoder model re-ranks search results by scoring query-document relevance, improving accuracy over initial retrievers. It uses a BERT-based MiniLM architecture fine-tuned on MS MARCO, balancing speed and precision. Technically, it jointly encodes query and document into a single relevance score, enabling deeper semantic matching. You can integrate it into a two-stage retrieval pipeline: first retrieve candidates via bi-encoders, then re-rank with this model. Ideal for search engines, QA systems, or any application needing precise text ranking.",
          "how": "Review https://huggingface.co/cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L12-v2 for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
