      "summaries": {
        "en": "Finance-Embeddings-Investopedia is a sentence-transformer model fine-tuned on Investopedia's financial glossary, designed to generate high-quality embeddings for financial text. Its key strength lies in domain-specific training, enabling accurate semantic similarity and retrieval for finance-related queries. Use it for tasks like financial document clustering, question answering, or building a finance-specific search engine. The model is compatible with Hugging Face's text-embeddings-inference and can be deployed on Azure.",
        "zh": "Finance-Embeddings-Investopedia是一个基于Investopedia金融术语表微调的句子嵌入模型，专为金融文本生成高质量向量表示。其核心优势在于领域特定训练，能够准确捕捉金融术语的语义相似性，适用于金融文档聚类、问答系统或构建金融搜索引擎。该模型支持Hugging Face的text-embeddings-inference推理框架，可部署在Azure上。通过该模型，开发者可以快速将金融文本转化为语义向量，提升金融NLP任务的准确性。",
        "es": "Finance-Embeddings-Investopedia is a sentence-transformer model fine-tuned on Investopedia's financial glossary, designed to generate high-quality embeddings for financial text. Its key strength lies in domain-specific training, enabling accurate semantic similarity and retrieval for finance-related queries. Use it for tasks like financial document clustering, question answering, or building a finance-specific search engine. The model is compatible with Hugging Face's text-embeddings-inference and can be deployed on Azure.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "finance-embeddings-investopedia stands out for sentence-transformers, safetensors, and bert in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Finance-Embeddings-Investopedia is a sentence-transformer model fine-tuned on Investopedia's financial glossary, designed to generate high-quality embeddings for financial text. Its key strength lies in domain-specific training, enabling accurate semantic similarity and retrieval for finance-related queries. Use it for tasks like financial document clustering, question answering, or building a finance-specific search engine. The model is compatible with Hugging Face's text-embeddings-inference and can be deployed on Azure.",
